n Dioxide\nFeds give Indiana, other states $1B for Midwest hydrogen hub. Will we lead on clean energy?\nTable of EPA's Draft and Final Class VI Well Permits\nBiden-Harris Administration Invests $251 Million to Expand Infrastructure to Support CO2 Transport and Storage\nstart animation\nslide 1 of 1\nHome\nGovernment\nOffices\nAuditor\nRelated Pages\nAssessor\nAuditor\nCircuit Court/Probation\nClerk\nCounty Commissioners / County Council\nCoroner\nProsecuting Attorney\nRecorder\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nVeteran Service Officer\nWarren County Area Plan & Zoning Office\nAuditor\nDuties: As County Auditors we must work together as a team with the Assessor and the Treasurer. Our duties are independent of one another, thus allowing us to reconcile against each other. Through the various applied checks and balances we are held to a high degree of accountability. This level of accountability is not only to the state agencies, but first and foremost we are accountable to the taxpayer.\nA few of the duties that are administered by the Auditor’s Office are payroll, accounts payable, budgets, abatements, employee benefits, property deductions and maintenance of the property transfer books.\nThe Auditor is Secretary to the County Commissioners, County Council, State Tax Adjustment Board, County Drainage Board, Board of Review and Data Board.\nLOCATION:\nWarren County Courthouse (Second Floor)\n125 N. Monroe Street, Suite 7\nWilliamsport, IN 47993\nPHONE:\n(765) 764-5888\nHOURS:\nMonday - Friday\n8:00 am to 4:00 pm EST\nClosed for major holidays\nAuditor\nRobin Weston-Hubner\nemail Email\nDeputy\nSue Johnson\nemail Email\nDeputy\nCori Herndon\nemail Email\nDeputy\nCharity Perigo\nemail Email\nNo results found.\nSearching...\nCurrent News:\nEFFECTIVE JULY 1, 2021- SALES DISCLOSURE FEE CHANGES TO $20.00 PER SALES DISCLOSURE FORM\nEFFECTIVE JANUARY 1, 2023- ALL TRANSFER DOCUMENTS ARE $10.00 (PLAT FEE) PER PER PARCEL\nDEED being defined as a signed instrument containing some legal transfer, bargain or contract; this includes:\nLand Contracts, Affidavits, Transfer on Death, and any other legal instrument for which the Auditor makes a real property endorsement.\nRefer to ORDINANCE #2019-1104B SIGNED BY THE WARREN COUNTY BOARD OF COMMISSIONERS FOR DETAILS.\nRobin Weston-Hubner\nSearch...\nCategories\n-->\n5 found\nin\n1 section(s)\nWarren County Auditor\nDeduction applications are due by December 31.\n5\nAge Deduction Form\nDisabled Veterans and Surviving Spouses Deduction\nHomestead Deduction Form\nBlind & Disabled Deduction Form\nONLINE TRANSFER BOOKS\n125 N. Monroe St., Williamsport, IN 47993\nOpen Weekdays 8:00 am - 4:00 pm\nperm_contact_cal\nContact Information\nSearch Warren County, Indiana\nSearch...\nLoading...\nSearch\nTry searching...\nSearch site for\nSearch documents for\nShare this page\nAccessibility features\nImportant You are about to leave Warren County, Indiana and visit an external site, do you wish to continue?\nYes, leave\nNo, Stay\nEvent Details\nCity Council Meeting\nView Calendar\nDescription\nRead More\nShare this page\nOn your favorite social media platform\nFacebook\nx(twitter)\nLinkedin\nreddit\nOr\nEmail Page Link\nCopy Current URL\nURL copied to clipboard!\nSearch\nNo matching languages.\nEnglish\nAfrikaans\nAlbanian\nArabic\nArmenian\nAzerbaijani\nBasque\nBelarusian\nBengali\nBosnian\nBulgarian\nCatalan\nCebuano\nChinese (Simplified)\nChinese (Traditional)\nCroatian\nCzech\nDanish\nDutch\nEsperanto\nEstonian\nFilipino\nFinnish\nFrench\nGalician\nGeorgian\nGerman\nGreek\nGujarati\nHaitian Creole\nHausa\nHebrew\nHindi\nHmong\nHungarian\nIcelandic\nIgbo\nIndonesian\nIrish\nItalian\nJapanese\nJavanese\nKannada\nKhmer\nKorean\nLao\nLatin\nLatvian\nLithuanian\nMacedonian\nMalay\nMaltese\nMaori\nMarathi\nMongolian\nNepali\nNorwegian\nPersian\nPolish\nPortuguese\nPunjabi\nRomanian\nRussian\nSerbian\nSlovak\nSlovenian\nSomali\nSpanish\nSwahili\nSwedish\nTamil\nTelugu\nThai\nTurkish\nUkrainian\nUrdu\nVietnamese\nWelsh\nYoruba\nZul